<span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Given a context and multiple options, choose the most reasonable continuation.</span></span>
<span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">Here is a question:<span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[header] How to take care of a budgie <math id="A5.F13.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\dots" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\dots</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
