<span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">A. Cockatiels only need a cage <math id="A5.F13.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\dots" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\dots</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
