<span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">D. The cage should be at least <math id="A5.F13.pic1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\dots" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\dots</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Let us do this task step by step.</span></span>
<span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The solution is: The question asks <math id="A5.F13.pic1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\dots" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\dots</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[OTHER FEW-SHOT EXAMPLES]</span></span>
<span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.12" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.12.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">Here is a question:<span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.12.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.13" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.13.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Several replays of acrobatic moves <math id="A5.F13.pic1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\dots" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\dots</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.14" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.14.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">Here are the options:<span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.14.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.15" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.15.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">A. go across the screen directing <math id="A5.F13.pic1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\dots" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\dots</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
